Box 48535 (never relayed until the founder's list, 52770): the owner wrote
„ჰკითხე თამარს, ხომ არ იცნობს კარგ არქიტექტორს…" and six sentences of
facts (Vake, a 600 m² slope plot, two floors, the budget, spring, slope
experience, English). The run sent nothing, so the server asked Tamar itself
(§97 item 1) with the instruction's question only — task_ask 18008, 71
characters, every fact dropped — while the owner was told his requirements
had gone.

The sentences AFTER the instruction now go with the question, whole
sentences only, inside createAsk's 600-character limit; the editor and the
§106 shortener („keep every fact") still run on the result. What the owner
wrote BEFORE the instruction is still never sent (QA-001). No new words.

